sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Administrator
    participant Helm as Helm / Kustomize
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>TLS
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Catalog as Catalog Sources<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Registry as Container Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Authorino as Authorino<br/>(RHCL/Kuadrant)
    participant Gateway as Gateway API

    rect rgb(213, 232, 212)
        Note over Admin,OLM: Flow 1: Kustomize Deployment (OpenShift)
        Admin->>K8s: kubectl apply -k dependencies/<br/>kubeconfig TLS, RBAC
        K8s->>OLM: Create Subscriptions<br/>(cert-manager, Kueue, RHCL, LWS, etc.)
        OLM->>Catalog: Resolve operator packages<br/>HTTPS/443
        OLM->>Registry: Pull operator images<br/>HTTPS/443, Pull Secret
        Admin->>K8s: kubectl apply -k configurations/<br/>kubeconfig TLS, RBAC
        Note right of K8s: Creates Kueue CR, Kuadrant CR,<br/>LeaderWorkerSetOperator CR
    end

    rect rgb(218, 232, 252)
        Note over Admin,Gateway: Flow 2: Helm Deployment (XKS)
        Admin->>Helm: helm install rhai-on-xks-chart
        Helm->>K8s: Deploy RHAI Operator<br/>ServiceAccount TLS
        Helm->>K8s: Deploy Cloud Manager Operator<br/>(AWS/Azure/CoreWeave)
        Helm->>K8s: Helm post-install hook:<br/>Create KubernetesEngine CR
        Helm->>K8s: Helm post-install hook:<br/>Create Platform CR + Component CRs
        Helm->>CertMgr: Create Certificate resources<br/>for Gateway TLS
        CertMgr-->>K8s: Issue TLS certificates<br/>ClusterIssuer
        Helm->>Gateway: Create inference-gateway<br/>443/TCP TLS Terminate
        Helm->>Gateway: Create maas-default-gateway<br/>443/TCP TLS Terminate
    end

    rect rgb(255, 242, 204)
        Note over Admin,Authorino: Flow 3: Authorino TLS Bootstrap
        Admin->>K8s: prepare-authorino-tls.sh<br/>Annotate Authorino service
        K8s->>CertMgr: service-serving-cert-signer<br/>Generate TLS secret
        CertMgr-->>K8s: authorino-server-cert
        Admin->>K8s: Patch Authorino CR<br/>with TLS config + CA trust
        K8s-->>Authorino: SSL_CERT_FILE updated<br/>CA bundle injected
    end
